\f4\fs40 \cf2 A Quick Note on CORS\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs34 \cf2 Because Active Storage often serves files via redirects (to an S3 bucket, Google Cloud Storage, etc.), ensure your cloud storage bucket's 
\f3\b CORS (Cross-Origin Resource Sharing)
\f0\b0  rules are set up to allow 
\f2\fs22\fsmilli11250 \cf6 \cb3 \strokec6 GET
\f0\fs34 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  requests from your Rails app's domain. Otherwise, the frontend 3D canvas will block the 
\f2\fs22\fsmilli11250 \cf6 \cb3 \strokec6 .glTF
\f0\fs34 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2  download for security reasons.\
Are you looking to simply let the homeowners view and rotate the ADUs, or are you planning to build out a configurator where they can interact with the models (like changing paint colors or adding custom features)?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

